      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:28/seg:0",
      "source": "\"The OS sends reads and writes to the disk\"",
      "source_hash": 1442444824805560147,
      "context_hash": 12325513712632444957,
      "translation": "\"OS가 디스크로 읽기와 쓰기를 보낸다\"",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:30.673037Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:29/seg:0",
      "source": "I/O is described by a [`bio`](bio-request.md), merged and queued as a `request`, reordered by an [I/O scheduler](io-schedulers.md), and dispatched to a hardware queue",
      "source_hash": 10700503199185049687,
      "context_hash": 6994875925098885840,
      "translation": "I/O는 [`bio`](bio-request.md)로 기술되고, `request`로 병합되어 큐에 들어가며, [I/O 스케줄러](io-schedulers.md)에 의해 재정렬된 뒤 하드웨어 큐로 디스패치됩니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hardware queue": "하드웨어 큐",
        "scheduler": "스케줄러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:30.673038Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:30/seg:0",
      "source": "\"One request queue per disk\"",
      "source_hash": 7560763068147622492,
      "context_hash": 6481194969238358773,
      "translation": "\"디스크마다 요청 큐가 하나 있다\"",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:30.673038Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:31/seg:0",
      "source": "[blk-mq](blk-mq.md) gives each CPU a software queue mapped onto the device's hardware queues — no shared lock",
      "source_hash": 2609264319037849763,
      "context_hash": 7423786477939797900,
      "translation": "[blk-mq](blk-mq.md)는 각 CPU에 디바이스의 하드웨어 큐에 매핑된 소프트웨어 큐를 제공하므로 공유 락이 없습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "blk-mq": "blk-mq",
        "device": "디바이스",
        "hardware queues": "하드웨어 큐",
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:28:15.945296Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:32/seg:0",
      "source": "\"The I/O scheduler makes things faster\"",
      "source_hash": 1551211385182527097,
      "context_hash": 9630202271715724930,
      "translation": "\"I/O 스케줄러가 속도를 높여 준다\"",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "scheduler": "스케줄러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:30.673038Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:33/seg:0",
      "source": "On fast SSDs the best scheduler is often *none*; scheduling mainly bounds latency and enforces fairness ([schedulers](io-schedulers.md))",
      "source_hash": 6170076323680833776,
      "context_hash": 13929097489633110258,
      "translation": "빠른 SSD에서는 *none*이 최선의 스케줄러인 경우가 많으며, 스케줄링은 주로 지연 시간을 제한하고 공정성을 보장하는 역할을 합니다([스케줄러](io-schedulers.md))",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "SSDs": "SSD",
        "latency": "지연 시간",
        "scheduler": "스케줄러",
        "schedulers": "스케줄러",
        "scheduling": "스케줄링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:30.673039Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:34/seg:0",
      "source": "\"`write()` goes to disk\"",
      "source_hash": 6813319600616662642,
      "context_hash": 57717580342551859,
      "translation": "\"`write()`는 디스크로 간다\"",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:30.673039Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:35/seg:0",
      "source": "It usually goes to the [page cache](../io/page-cache-writeback.md); the block layer only sees it later, during writeback",
      "source_hash": 1020193303018328281,
      "context_hash": 16504787052339137089,
      "translation": "대개 [페이지 캐시](../io/page-cache-writeback.md)로 가며, 블록 계층은 나중에 writeback 과정에서야 이를 보게 됩니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "block layer": "블록 계층",
        "page cache": "페이지 캐시",
        "writeback": "writeback"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:30.673039Z",
      "issues": []
    },
